---
export const prerender = true;

import Footer from '../components/landing/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/landing/Header.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | kgentik"
  description="Privacy Policy for kgentik, including what information we collect, how we use it, and how we handle third-party service providers."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="bg-surface">
    <article class="section-y">
      <div class="site-container max-w-3xl">
        <header class="mb-10">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-4 text-secondary">Legal</p>
          <h1 class="mb-6 font-display text-display text-primary">Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Last updated: May 2, 2026</p>
        </header>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-outline-variant bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-10">
          <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-primary prose-a:text-secondary prose-strong:text-primary">
            <p>
              This Privacy Policy explains how kgentik handles information when you visit our website or use our products
              and services (the "Service"). By using the Service, you agree to this policy.
            </p>

            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>We may collect information you provide directly, including:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>name, business name, email address, phone number, and contact details;</li>
              <li>account, billing, support, and onboarding information;</li>
              <li>messages, files, prompts, customer details, and business content you choose to provide;</li>
              <li>feedback, survey responses, and communications with us.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              We may also collect technical and usage information, such as device information, browser type, IP address,
              pages viewed, referring URLs, approximate location, logs, and interactions with the Service.
            </p>

            <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
            <p>We use information to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>provide, operate, maintain, and improve the Service;</li>
              <li>respond to enquiries, support requests, and onboarding needs;</li>
              <li>configure automations, workflows, and AI-assisted features;</li>
              <li>process payments and manage accounts;</li>
              <li>monitor security, prevent misuse, and troubleshoot issues;</li>
              <li>send service updates, administrative notices, and marketing communications where permitted.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. AI and Service Providers</h2>
            <p>
              To provide the Service, we may use third-party hosting, analytics, communications, payment, infrastructure,
              and AI service providers. Information may be processed by those providers on our behalf.
            </p>
            <p>
              We do not control every third-party platform you connect to the Service. Their privacy policies and terms may
              also apply.
            </p>

            <h2>4. Business Customer Data</h2>
            <p>
              If you provide customer, lead, quote, marketing, or operational data to the Service, you are responsible for
              ensuring you have the rights and permissions needed to provide and process that data.
            </p>

            <h2>5. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
            <p>
              We may use cookies, pixels, analytics tools, and similar technologies to understand website traffic, improve
              the Service, remember preferences, and measure marketing performance. You can control cookies through your
              browser settings, but some features may not work properly if cookies are disabled.
            </p>

            <h2>6. Sharing Information</h2>
            <p>We may share information:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>with service providers who help us run the Service;</li>
              <li>with third-party platforms you choose to connect;</li>
              <li>to comply with law, legal process, or government requests;</li>
              <li>to protect rights, safety, security, and prevent misuse;</li>
              <li>as part of a business transfer, merger, acquisition, financing, or sale of assets.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>We do not sell personal information in the ordinary sense of exchanging it for money.</p>

            <h2>7. Security</h2>
            <p>
              We use reasonable technical and organizational measures designed to protect information. No system is fully
              secure, and we cannot guarantee that information will always remain private, secure, or available.
            </p>

            <h2>8. Retention</h2>
            <p>
              We keep information for as long as reasonably needed to provide the Service, comply with legal obligations,
              resolve disputes, enforce agreements, maintain security, and support legitimate business needs.
            </p>

            <h2>9. International Processing</h2>
            <p>
              Information may be processed and stored in countries other than where you live. Those countries may have data
              protection laws different from your local laws.
            </p>

            <h2>10. Your Choices</h2>
            <p>
              Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, restrict, or object to certain
              uses of personal information. You may also unsubscribe from marketing emails using the link in those emails.
            </p>

            <h2>11. Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>
              The Service is intended for businesses and is not directed to children. We do not knowingly collect personal
              information from children.
            </p>

            <h2>12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
              We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated version will be posted on this page with a
              new "Last updated" date.
            </p>

            <h2>13. Contact</h2>
            <p>
              Questions about this Privacy Policy can be sent through the contact options available on the kgentik website.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
